        "original_id": "af724247-fd07-55a2-8ae1-a0428ee92382",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Attractions: Rocket Rods, PeopleMover\n- Projects: New Tomorrowland\n- Places: Tomorrowland, Disneyland, Anaheim, California\n- Restaurants: Redd Rockett's Pizza Port\n\nFacts:\n- The PeopleMover operated in Tomorrowland at Disneyland in Anaheim, California, from July 2, 1967 to August 21, 1995.\n- Rocket Rods was a high-speed thrill attraction in Tomorrowland at Disneyland in Anaheim, California.\n- Rocket Rods opened in 1998 on the existing PeopleMover infrastructure as part of the New Tomorrowland project.\n- Rocket Rods was designed to evoke a futuristic rapid transit system.\n- Redd Rockett's Pizza Port opened with New Tomorrowland on May 22, 1998.\n- New Tomorrowland opened on May 22, 1998 with Astro Orbitor, Honey, I Shrunk the Audience, and Rocket Rods.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
